    {
      "id": "claim_70ee51a5e8124996a75557dd316e3266",
      "statement": "The transcriber has two OpenRouter HTTP seams: an OpenAI-format `/audio/transcriptions` STT seam that posts a JSON base64 audio body, and a shared `/chat/completions` chat seam used by both the slides backend and the summarize backend; both resolve the API key at use time and attach public attribution headers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://transcriber/backends/openrouter.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:4aab40ddd17c176415c3b7c2b690ef22e47e8bd9bff86144190daf4085aee4be"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://transcriber/backends/summarize_agno.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:0146ba5304cfd45fc2db0991a228ea88e21a14f63c05fc3b7a35cc8e7fe7e139"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://transcriber/backends/transcribe_openrouter.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:e0b7a84c4b905641436c2d664e78960482ad34c51743c34840b52da89e185692"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_410b601a87314903a966b863eb124ffa",
      "statement": "Both OpenRouter seams retry transient `429`/`5xx` responses with bounded exponential backoff up to `MAX_ATTEMPTS = 4`, but a `400` from the STT seam fails immediately with no silent fallback; transport errors are also retried within the cap.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://transcriber/backends/openrouter.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:4aab40ddd17c176415c3b7c2b690ef22e47e8bd9bff86144190daf4085aee4be"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://transcriber/backends/transcribe_openrouter.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:e0b7a84c4b905641436c2d664e78960482ad34c51743c34840b52da89e185692"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6b0cdab8245f47fd86b9485ea816b02d",
      "statement": "When the `openrouter` config section is missing at a seam, the STT seam raises `TranscribeError` and the shared chat seam raises the caller-supplied error type (`SlideDescribeError` for slides, `SummarizeError` for summarize); both treat a missing config section as a hard failure rather than a silent fallback.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://transcriber/backends/openrouter.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:4aab40ddd17c176415c3b7c2b690ef22e47e8bd9bff86144190daf4085aee4be"
        },
        {
