      "statement": "Per-slide timestamps are passed as a `Timestamp: MM:SS - MM:SS` text part immediately before the `image_url` part, with unknown timing rendered as the literal `unknown`; an empty slide set returns `\"\"` with no HTTP call and a valid empty/whitespace response contributes nothing.",
