    {
      "id": "claim_e4b8043a42b74ddca10634442427145d",
      "statement": "The STT response parser is defensive: it prefers `segments`, falls back to `words` for per-speaker turns, extracts `usage.cost`, and degrades to flat `raw_text` with a warning when diarization yields no parseable shape rather than crashing silently.",
