      "id": "claim_a908605596fc4153bd6c0ac4f6afe993",
      "statement": "Per-model diarization toggles are registered by model slug substring; only `microsoft/mai-transcribe-2` currently has a provider diarization block, and an unknown model sends `verbose_json` without a toggle and relies on native diarization, failing cleanly on a 400 if unsupported.",
