      "id": "claim_af83e7cd161b4095a1c97d5cb930fbdc",
      "statement": "The `transcribe` stage uses a `segments.json` manifest under `transcribe_work.<name>` for per-segment idempotency and a parameter guard; completed parts are reused and never re-issued, and a stored `segment_seconds`/`overlap_seconds` mismatch discards the work dir and rechunks.",
