      "statement": "OpenRouter-related timeouts live in `transcriber.config.Timeouts` with a `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS = 900` default applied per field; `summarize` is optional and `None` falls back to `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` at use time (used by the `agno` backend).",
