      "id": "claim_7dd1e7724e844fdd930701f34992c4aa",
      "statement": "The OpenRouter integration enforces log hygiene across both seams and error types: the API key, request headers, and base64 payloads are never logged or embedded in exceptions; errors carry only the HTTP status and a short truncated body snippet bounded by `_SNIPPET_LEN = 200`.",
