      "statement": "The backend still named `agno` produces the summary and digest via direct OpenRouter chat-completions calls (`_openrouter_chat` with `summary_model`), while Notion publish is engine-side via the Notion REST API, not model tool-calling, because the official Notion MCP tool schemas break tool-calling over OpenRouter for some models.",
