      "id": "claim_d31c6666937541269159a4cebdf37e01",
      "statement": "Config load validates that `stages.slides.backend == \"openrouter\"` (the only allowed value); the orchestrator's `_get_slides_backend` returns `OpenRouterSlidesBackend()` and defensively raises `ValueError` on any other value rather than silently falling back.",
